{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 20:14:20.089766", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content=\"Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is based on a scalable SDN spine-leaf topology. It consists of:\\n- **OVS Switches**: `leaf_1`, `leaf_2`, `spine_1`\\n- **Hosts**: `host_1_1`, `host_1_2`, `host_2_1`, `host_2_2`\\n- **Subnets**:\\n  - Host subnet: `10.0.0.0/24`\\n  - Management subnet: `20.0.0.0/24`\\n- **SDN Controller**: Located at `20.0.0.100`, managing switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Observations from Reachability Test\\nThe reachability test results between hosts are as follows:\\n\\n1. **Host-to-Host Communication**:\\n   - **`host_1_1` to `host_2_2`**:\\n     - Status: `unknown`\\n     - No packets transmitted or received.\\n   - **`host_1_1` to `host_2_1`**:\\n     - Status: `unknown`\\n     - No packets transmitted or received.\\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_2_2`**:\\n     - Status: `ok`\\n     - Packet Loss: `0%`\\n     - RTT (Round-Trip Time): Average `6.741 ms`, Min `0.618 ms`, Max `12.864 ms`, Std Dev `6.123 ms`\\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_2_1`**:\\n     - Status: `ok`\\n     - Packet Loss: `0%`\\n     - RTT: Average `6.707 ms`, Min `1.783 ms`, Max `11.632 ms`, Std Dev `4.924 ms`\\n   - **`host_2_1` to `host_2_2`**:\\n     - Status: `ok`\\n     - Packet Loss: `0%`\\n     - RTT: Average `3.468 ms`, Min `1.073 ms`, Max `5.863 ms`, Std Dev `2.395 ms`\\n   - **`host_2_2` to `host_2_1`**:\\n     - Status: `ok`\\n     - Packet Loss: `0%`\\n     - RTT: Average `1.757 ms`, Min `0.605 ms`, Max `2.91 ms`, Std Dev `1.152 ms`\\n\\n#### Analysis\\n1. **Anomalies Detected**:\\n   - Communication from `host_1_1` to both `host_2_1` and `host_2_2` is failing (`status: unknown`). This indicates potential issues with either:\\n     - The connectivity between `host_1_1` and the leaf switch (`leaf_1`).\\n     - The routing or forwarding rules in the SDN controller or switches.\\n\\n2. **Normal Behavior**:\\n   - Communication between `host_1_2`, `host_2_1`, and `host_2_2` is functioning correctly with no packet loss and reasonable RTT values.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to identify the root cause of the anomaly affecting `host_1_1`. This may involve:\\n- Checking the network configuration of `host_1_1`.\\n- Verifying the OpenFlow rules and connectivity on `leaf_1`.\\n- Examining the SDN controller's management of the switches.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.\" additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='c1e0e2ec-16d5-472c-93a9-158197d13064'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
